function decodeEntities(s){for(let n=0;n<2;n++)s=String(s||'').replace(/&lt;/g,'<').replace(/&gt;/g,'>').replace(/&quot;/g,'"').replace(/&#0?39;|&apos;/g,"'").replace(/&#(\d+);/g,(_,n)=>String.fromCodePoint(Math.min(Number(n),1114111))).replace(/&(mdash|ndash|rsquo|lsquo|rdquo|ldquo|bull|hellip);/g,(_,name)=>({mdash:'—',ndash:'–',rsquo:'’',lsquo:'‘',rdquo:'”',ldquo:'“',bull:'•',hellip:'…'}[name])).replace(/&amp;/g,'&');return s}
function sourceText(html){return clean(decodeEntities(html).replace(/<\/(?:p|li|h[1-6]|div)>/gi,'. '))}
function opportunityLines(html){let decoded=decodeEntities(html);let main=(decoded.match(/<main\b[^>]*>([\s\S]*?)<\/main>/i)||[])[1]||decoded;main=main.split(/<(?:footer|aside)\b|<h[23][^>]*>\s*(?:News|Similar Jobs|Related)/i)[0];return sourceText(main).split(/(?<=[.!?])\s+/).map(x=>x.trim()).filter(x=>x.length>25&&x.length<1000)}
function extractRequirements(html){let decoded=decodeEntities(html),marker=decoded.search(/(?:Minimum|Preferred|Basic|Required) Qualifications|What [Yy]ou(?:’|')?ll [Bb]ring|(?:Requirements|Qualifications)\s*</i);let section=marker>=0?decoded.slice(marker,marker+10000):decoded;return opportunityLines(section).filter(t=>/must|pursuing|enrolled|qualification|require|proficien|ability|knowledge|experience|skills|degree|graduate|undergraduate/i.test(t)&&!/equal opportunity|salary of the finalist|discrimination|privacy|accommodation/i.test(t)).slice(0,8)}

function htmlFragments(html){return decodeEntities(html).replace(/<script\b[^>]*>[\s\S]*?<\/script>/gi,' ').replace(/<br\s*\/?>|<\/(?:p|li|div|h[1-6])>/gi,'\n').split(/\n+/).map(clean).filter(Boolean)}
function extractPay(html){let fragments=htmlFragments(html),currency=/[$€£]|\b(?:USD|EUR|GBP)\b/;let candidates=fragments.filter(t=>currency.test(t));let line=candidates.find(t=>/salary range|hourly pay|stipend|funding|compensation|pay range/i.test(t)&&t.length<600)||candidates.find(t=>t.length<200);if(!line)return null;if(line.length>180){let amount=(line.match(/(?:[$€£]\s*[\d,]+(?:\.\d+)?)(?:\s*(?:—|–|-|to)\s*[$€£]?\s*[\d,]+(?:\.\d+)?)?(?:\s*(?:USD|EUR|GBP|per hour|\/hr))?/i)||[])[0];return amount?amount+' · '+(/funding|stipend|award/i.test(line)?'funding / award':'source pay range')+' (see source for terms)':line.slice(0,180)}if(/^[\$€£]/.test(line)&&!/per hour|per year|\/hr|annual/i.test(line)&&/hourly (?:base )?(?:pay|rate)/i.test(sourceText(html)))return line+' per hour (source disclosure)';return line}
function postingSummary(html){let fragments=htmlFragments(html),index=fragments.findIndex(t=>/^Position Summary$|^What you(?:’|')?ll (?:do|be doing)|^Responsibilities$/i.test(t));return index>=0?fragments.slice(index+1,index+4).join(' ').slice(0,500):''}

function fieldsFromText(description,title,html){let lower=description.toLowerCase(),requirements=extractRequirements(html||description),reqText=requirements.join(' ');let payLine=extractPay(html||description);let payStatus=/\bunpaid\b/i.test(description)?'Unpaid':payLine||/\bpaid (?:internship|position|role)\b/i.test(description)?'Paid':'Not stated';let hours=description.match(/Hours Per Week\s*:\s*(\d{1,2})|(?:commit(?:ment)? (?:of |to )?|minimum of |at least )(\d{1,2}) hours (?:per week|a week|weekly)/i);let levels=/\bPh\.?D\b|Doctoral/i.test(title)?['Doctoral']:/\bMBA\b/i.test(title)?['Master’s']:[];if(!levels.length&&/\b(?:currently|must be)\b.{0,40}(?:enrolled|pursuing).{0,80}(?:bachelor|undergraduate)/i.test(reqText)&&!/master|ph\.?d|doctoral/i.test(reqText))levels=['First year','Sophomore','Junior','Senior'];let win=reqText.match(/graduat[\s\S]{0,80}?between\s+(?:[A-Za-z]+\s+)?(20\d{2})\s+(?:and|[-–])\s+(?:[A-Za-z]+\s+)?(20\d{2})/i);return {requirements,payStatus,payText:payLine?payLine.slice(0,180):payStatus==='Unpaid'?'Unpaid as described by source':'Not stated — confirm on source',weeklyHours:hours?Number(hours[1]||hours[2]):null,levels,graduationWindow:win?[Number(win[1]),Number(win[2])]:null}}
async function limitedJSON(url,max=6000000){let r=await fetch(url,{signal:AbortSignal.timeout(18000),redirect:'error',headers:{Accept:'application/json'}});if(!r.ok)throw Error('Source returned '+r.status);let parts=[],size=0,reader=r.body.getReader();while(true){let {value,done}=await reader.read();if(done)break;size+=value.length;if(size>max){await reader.cancel();throw Error('Source exceeds size limit')}parts.push(value)}let data=new Uint8Array(size),offset=0;for(let p of parts){data.set(p,offset);offset+=p.length}return JSON.parse(new TextDecoder().decode(data))}
function publicJobURL(raw){try{let u=new URL(raw);return u.protocol==='https:'&&!u.username&&!u.password&&(/(^|\.)greenhouse\.io$|(^|\.)figma\.com$|(^|\.)duolingo\.com$/.test(u.hostname))?u.href:null}catch{return null}}
function explicitDeadline(description){let match=description.match(/Application Deadline\s*:?\s*([A-Za-z]+\s+\d{1,2}(?:st|nd|rd|th)?[,]?\s+20\d{2})/i);if(!match)return null;let d=new Date(match[1].replace(/(\d)(st|nd|rd|th)/g,'$1')+' 12:00:00 GMT');return Number.isFinite(d.getTime())?d.toISOString().slice(0,10):null}
async function loadPublicOpportunities(){let items=[],sources=[],now=new Date().toISOString();await Promise.all([...PUBLIC_BOARDS.map(async board=>{let url='https://boards-api.greenhouse.io/v1/boards/'+board.token+'/jobs?content=true';try{let d=await limitedJSON(url),jobs=d.jobs.filter(j=>/\bintern(?:ship)?\b|early career|new grad|entry[ -]level|university grad/i.test(j.title)&&j.internal_job_id!==null);let rows=jobs.map(j=>{let description=sourceText(j.content||''),link=publicJobURL(j.absolute_url);return {id:board.token+'-'+j.id,title:j.title,organization:board.name,url:link,type:/\bintern/i.test(j.title)?'Internship':'Industry role',description:description.slice(0,22000),summary:postingSummary(j.content),...fieldsFromText(description,j.title,j.content),deadline:j.application_deadline?.slice(0,10)||explicitDeadline(description),expires:null,location:j.location?.name||'See source',checkedAt:now,status:'On public job board',source:'Greenhouse public job board',board:board.token,boardId:j.id}}).filter(j=>j.url);items.push(...rows);sources.push({name:board.name,status:'Read',count:rows.length,checkedAt:now,url:'https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/'+board.token})}catch(e){sources.push({name:board.name,status:'Unavailable',count:0,error:e.message,url:'https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/'+board.token})}}),...COLUMBIA_OPPORTUNITIES.map(async source=>{try{let doc=await page(source.url);let ld;for(let m of doc.html.matchAll(/<script[^>]*type=["']application\/ld\+json["'][^>]*>([\s\S]*?)<\/script>/gi)){try{let d=JSON.parse(m[1]);let candidates=Array.isArray(d)?d:d['@graph']||[d];ld=candidates.find(j=>j['@type']==='JobPosting')||ld}catch{}}let main=(doc.html.match(/<main\b[^>]*>([\s\S]*?)<\/main>/i)||[])[1]||doc.html;let title=clean((main.match(/<h1\b[^>]*>([\s\S]*?)<\/h1>/i)||[])[1]||source.needle);if(!sourceText(main).toLowerCase().includes(source.needle.toLowerCase()))throw Error('Expected listing not found');let lines=opportunityLines(ld?.description||main);let description=sourceText(ld?.description||main.split(/<(?:footer|aside)\b|<h[23][^>]*>\s*(?:News|Similar Jobs|Related)/i)[0]).slice(0,22000),fields=fieldsFromText(description,title,ld?.description||main);if(source.levels)fields.levels=source.levels;let deadline=ld?.applicationDeadline?.slice(0,10)||explicitDeadline(description),closed=/applications? (?:are |is )?(?:now )?closed|no longer accepting|position has been filled/i.test(description);let location=(ld?.jobLocation?.[0]?.address?.addressLocality)||'See Columbia source';items.push({id:source.id,title:ld?.title||title,organization:source.organization,url:doc.url,type:source.type,description,summary:postingSummary(ld?.description||main),...fields,schools:source.schools||[],deadline,expires:ld?.validThrough||null,location,checkedAt:now,status:closed?'Closed':'Source page available — confirm accepting',source:'Columbia public listing'});sources.push({name:source.organization+' · '+source.needle,status:'Read',count:1,checkedAt:now,url:doc.url})}catch(e){sources.push({name:source.organization+' · '+source.needle,status:'Unavailable',count:0,error:e.message,url:source.url})}})]);return {items,sources,checkedAt:now}}
async function opportunitiesResponse(request){try{let raw=await request.text();if(raw.length>120000)throw Error('Profile is too long.');let profile=JSON.parse(raw||'{}');let data=await loadPublicOpportunities();data.items.sort((a,b)=>evaluateOpportunity(b,profile).score-evaluateOpportunity(a,profile).score);return Response.json(data,{headers:{'Cache-Control':'no-store'}})}catch(e){return Response.json({error:e.message},{status:400})}}

const PDF_ASSETS = null;
const app = {async fetch(request){let u=new URL(request.url);if(u.pathname==='/assets/pdf.mjs'||u.pathname==='/assets/pdf.worker.mjs'){let key=u.pathname.endsWith('worker.mjs')?'worker':'module';return PDF_ASSETS?new Response(PDF_ASSETS[key],{headers:{'Content-Type':'text/javascript;charset=utf-8','Cache-Control':'public,max-age=86400'}}):new Response('PDF assets not built',{status:503})}if(u.pathname==='/api/opportunities'&&request.method==='POST')return opportunitiesResponse(request);if(u.pathname==='/api/discover'&&request.method==='POST')return discoverResponse(request);if(u.pathname==='/api/people'&&request.method==='GET')return peopleResponse();if(u.pathname==='/api/draft'&&request.method==='POST')return draftResponse(request);if(u.pathname==='/api/match'&&request.method==='POST'){try{if(Number(request.headers.get('content-length'))>120000)return Response.json({error:'CV is too long.'},{status:400});let body=await request.text();if(body.length>120000)throw Error('CV is too long.');let {cv,interests,url}=JSON.parse(body);if(typeof cv!=='string'||cv.length<80)throw Error('Please add your CV text.');url=safeURL(url);if(!url)throw Error('Use an HTTPS URL on columbia.edu or a Columbia subdomain.');let counts={};for(let t of terms(cv+' '+(interests||'')+' '+(interests||'')))counts[t]=(counts[t]||0)+1;let keywords=Object.keys(counts).sort((a,b)=>counts[b]-counts[a]).slice(0,70);let root=await page(url);let links=[...root.html.matchAll(/<a\b[^>]*href\s*=\s*["']([^"']+)["'][^>]*>([\s\S]*?)<\/a>/gi)].map(m=>({url:safeURL(m[1],root.url),name:clean(m[2])})).filter(x=>x.url&&x.url!==root.url&&x.name.length>4&&x.name.length<90&&!/directory|login|sign in|privacy|accessibility|contact|news|events|giving|apply|admission|twitter|linkedin/i.test(x.name)&&/faculty|people|person|profile|directory|\/content\/|~|\/bio/i.test(x.url));links=[...new Map(links.map(x=>[x.url,x])).values()].slice(0,18);let pages=[{...root,name:''}],failed=0;for(let i=0;i<links.length;i+=6){await Promise.all(links.slice(i,i+6).map(async l=>{try{pages.push({...await page(l.url),name:l.name})}catch{failed++}}))}let results=pages.map(p=>{let content=clean((p.html.match(/<main\b[^>]*>([\s\S]*?)<\/main>/i)||[])[1]||p.html);let set=new Set(terms(content));let shared=keywords.filter(k=>set.has(k));let h1=clean((p.html.match(/<h1\b[^>]*>([\s\S]*?)<\/h1>/i)||[])[1]||'');let title=clean((p.html.match(/<title[^>]*>([\s\S]*?)<\/title>/i)||[])[1]||'Columbia faculty page');let name=p.name||h1||title;let idx=content.toLowerCase().indexOf(shared[0]);let excerpt=content.slice(Math.max(0,idx-90),Math.max(0,idx-90)+430);return {url:p.url,name,shared,excerpt,date:new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10),directory:p.url===root.url&&links.length>0}}).filter(r=>r.shared.length>0&&!r.directory).sort((a,b)=>b.shared.length-a.shared.length);return Response.json({results,scanned:pages.length,failed})}catch(e){return Response.json({error:e.message==='Could not read faculty page'?'The Columbia page could not be read. Try a direct faculty profile or another department directory.':e.message},{status:400})}}if(u.pathname==='/')return new Response(HTML,{headers:{'content-type':'text/html;charset=utf-8','X-Content-Type-Options':'nosniff','Referrer-Policy':'no-referrer'}});return new Response('Not found',{status:404})}};

export default app;
